_stem":null,"text":"Determine the initial acceleration of the cube.\nacceleration = $m s ^{2} $","marks":2,"answer_prompt":null,"unit":null},{"id":"9702_w17_22_q03_e_ii","label":"(e)(ii)","part_stem":null,"text":"Describe and explain the variation, if any, of the acceleration of the cube as it sinks in the water.","marks":2,"answer_prompt":null,"unit":null}],"figures_referenced":[]},"issues":[],"sourcePath":"past papers/p2/2017/october-november/variant-2/question_03"}
